{
  "profileKey": "apple-macos-26.5-1x-light-standard",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "$comment": [
    "TUNED MATERIAL CONSTANTS for the light-standard profile \u2014 C9a.",
    "",
    "This file supersedes nothing: apple-macos-26.5.seed.json remains the record",
    "of what C7 could and could not answer, and every material entry there is",
    "still marked `unmeasured` for the reason it gives. This file is the answer to",
    "the subset those entries named, measured against the real ScreenCaptureKit",
    "fixtures once the grant landed.",
    "",
    "`patch` is a @vitrea/renderer-webgpu MaterialProfilePatch, applicable as-is:",
    "",
    "    createGlassRoot({ materialProfile: patch })",
    "",
    "For THIS profile the patch is deliberately the identity \u2014 the renderer's",
    "DEFAULT_MATERIAL_PROFILE already carries these numbers, because light-standard",
    "is the profile the shipped default targets. Since 2026-09-01 the patch names",
    "every constant the calibration pipeline FITTED, not only the ones that happened",
    "to differ from a default, so the identity is an assertion rather than a silence",
    "\u2014 see `$comment-provenance`. A test pins the equality AND the resolved",
    "fingerprint, so the file and the runtime cannot drift apart silently. The dark",
    "sibling stays a real difference patch, since only one set of numbers can be the",
    "default.",
    "Every number is stated with what moved it and what it did NOT close."
  ],
